<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on several exchange rates.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on several exchange rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York and Frankfurt said it has issued call and put warrants of 10 million warrants per series on the yen/mark, dollar/yen and the dollar/mark exchange rates.</p>
<p>The prices of all warrants are denominated in marks.</p>
<p>There is a payment date of June 5, 1997 and a minimum exercise of 100 warrants each series.</p>
<p>The warrants will be listed in Dusseldorf and Frankfurt. --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
